## 5. NOT this phase — application team (Anuroop)

Do not implement. Listed so the boundary is clear.

**pass-offerings (server):** mount `pass-offerings-tls` secret, serve TLS on `8443`, add the container/Service port, switch health probes to `scheme: HTTPS` (else crashloop).

**pass-admin (client):** trust the CA (bundle delivered via trust-manager, §6), change URL to `https://pass-offerings.pass.svc.cluster.local:8443`.

cert-manager produces a secret. It does **not** make anything speak HTTPS. A cert on disk is inert until the app loads it.

