## 6. Next phase — trust-manager (CA bundle distribution)

pass-admin needs to trust the CA that signed pass-offerings' cert. trust-manager publishes the CA bundle as a ConfigMap into the `pass` namespace so pods can mount it, instead of hand-copying the CA everywhere.

Steps (separate work item):
- Install trust-manager via Helm (image + chart from JFrog, pinned version).
- Create a `Bundle` resource sourcing `ca.crt` from `onepass-internal-ca-secret`, targeting a ConfigMap in `pass`.
- Verify: `kubectl get configmap -n pass onepass-internal-ca-bundle`

